        {
          "source": "fda-otezla",
          "section": "8.1"
        }
      ]
    },
    "lactation": {
      "level": "caution",
      "text": {
        "fa": "برچسب: در شیردهی با احتیاط؛ متن برچسب را ببینید.",
        "en": "Label: use with caution while breastfeeding; see the label text."
      },
      "quote": "Risk Summary There are no data on the presence of apremilast in human milk, its effects on the breastfed infant, or its effects on milk production.",
      "refs": [
        {
          "source": "fda-otezla",
          "section": "8.2"
        }
      ]
    },
    "pediatric": {
      "level": "caution",
      "text": {
        "fa": "برچسب برای کودکان شرط، محدودیت سنی یا نکته دارد؛ جمله برچسب در زیر آمده است.",
        "en": "The label has conditions, age limits or notes for children; the label sentence is quoted below."
      },
      "quote": "OTEZLA Plaque Psoriasis The safety and effectiveness of OTEZLA have been established in pediatric patients 6 years of age and older and weighing at least 20 kg with moderate to severe plaque psoriasis who are candidates for phototherapy or systemic therapy.",
      "refs": [
        {
          "source": "fda-otezla",
          "section": "8.4"
        }
      ]
    },
